R4: Uncertainty in the known gamma (draught)
run 20261001_183822, MATLAB 25.1.0.2973910 (R2025a) Update 1, code commit 1147d1f, 476 s

Setting: p0, Level 2C (ref s26), N = 65536, L = 2048, JONSWAP Hs 0.05 m, omega_p 5.0 rad/s.
